,{
"ClauseCode":"1001454"
,"ClauseContent":"INSTITUTE CYBER ATTACK EXCLUSION CLAUSE 10/11/03"
,"ClauseDescription":"<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:9px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif;\">1.1  Subject only to clause 1.2 below, in no case shall this insurance cover loss damage liability or expense directly or indirectly caused by or contributed to by or arising from the use or operation, as a mean of inflicting harm, of any computer, <br />\ncomputer system, computer software programme, malicious code, computer  virus or process or any other electro system.</span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:9px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif;\">1.2 Where this clause is endorse on policies covering risks of war, civil war, revolution, rebellion, insurrection, or civil strife arising therefrom, or any hostile by or against a belligerent power, or terrorism or any person acting from a political motive, <br />\nClause 1.1 shall not operate to exclude losses (which would otherwise be covered) arising from the use of any computer, computer system or computer software programme or any other electronic computer system in the launch and/or guidance system and/or firing mechanism of any weapon or missile.</span></span></p>\n\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\"> </div>"
,"ClauseTitle":"INSTITUTE CYBER ATTACK EXCLUSION CLAUSE 10/11/03 (CL 380)"
,"ClauseType":"MARINE"
,"FlagOldData":"1"
,"KodeSection":"1"
,"pxObjClass":"ASM-FW-GISFW-Data-Clause"
,"pyExpanded":"true"
