"ClauseCode":"1001407"
,"ClauseContent":"IT HAZARD CLARIFICATION CLAUSE"
,"ClauseDescription":"<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:9px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif;\">Loss arising, directly or indirectly, out of :</span></span></p>\n\n<ol>\n\t<li style=\"font-size: 9px; text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:9px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif;\">Loss of, alteration of, or damage to or</span></span></li>\n\t<li style=\"font-size: 9px; text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:9px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif;\">A reduction in the functionality, availability or operation of</span></span></li>\n</ol>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:9px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif;\">A computer system, hardware, programme, software, date, information repository, microchip, integrated circuit or similar device in computer equipment or non-computer equipment, whether the property of the policyholder of the reinsured or not, do not in and of themselves constitute an event unless arising out of one or more of the following perils : Fire, Lightning, Explosion, Aircraft or Vehicle Impact, Falling Objects, Windstorm, Hail, Tornado, Cyclone, Hurricane, Earthquake, Volcano, Tsunami, Flood, Freeze or Weights of Snow.</span></span></p>"
,"ClauseTitle":"IT HAZARD CLARIFICATION CLAUSE"
,"ClauseType":"MARINE"
,"FlagOldData":"1"
,"KodeSection":"1"
,"pxObjClass":"ASM-FW-GISFW-Data-Clause"
,"OldClause":[ 
{
"ClauseCode":"1001407"
,"ClauseContent":"IT HAZARD CLARIFICATION CLAUSE"
,"ClauseDescription":"<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:9px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif;\">Loss arising, directly or indirectly, out of :</span></span></p>\n\n<ol>\n\t<li style=\"font-size: 9px; text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:9px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif;\">Loss of, alteration of, or damage to or</span></span></li>\n\t<li style=\"font-size: 9px; text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:9px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif;\">A reduction in the functionality, availability or operation of</span></span></li>\n</ol>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:9px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif;\">A computer system, hardware, programme, software, date, information repository, microchip, integrated circuit or similar device in computer equipment or non-computer equipment, whether the property of the policyholder of the reinsured or not, do not in and of themselves constitute an event unless arising out of one or more of the following perils : Fire, Lightning, Explosion, Aircraft or Vehicle Impact, Falling Objects, Windstorm, Hail, Tornado, Cyclone, Hurricane, Earthquake, Volcano, Tsunami, Flood, Freeze or Weights of Snow.</span></span></p>"
,"ClauseTitle":"IT HAZARD CLARIFICATION CLAUSE"
,"ClauseType":"MARINE"
,"KodeSection":"1"
,"pxObjClass":"ASM-FW-GISFW-Data-Clause"
}
] 
