,"ClauseContent":"CANCELLATION CLAUSE"
,"ClauseDescription":"<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:9px;\">1) War Risks 7 days&rsquo; notice 2) Strikes, Riots and Civil 7 days&rsquo; notice but 48 hours in respect of sending to or from U.S.A (Commotions Risks) 3) All other risks 30 days&rsquo; notice Cancellation shall become effective on the expire of the appropriate number of the days from midnight of the day on which notice of cancellation is issued by or to the Underwriters but shall not apply to any transit insurance, which shall have been declared or attached in accordance with Contract terms and conditions before the cancellation becomes effective</span></span></p>"
,"ClauseTitle":"CANCELLATION CLAUSE 30 DAYS"
